OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foccasional outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle for much of the night,
OL,8,Falthough the odd clear spell cannot be
OL,9,Fruled out. A band of rain, locally
OL,10,Fheavy, then moves into northwestern
OL,11,Fparts before dawn. Winds strengthening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FBlustery rainband, locally
OL,14,Fheavy, continues east at first,
OL,15,Fclearing late morning. Sunny spells
OL,16,Fand a few showers follow, most
OL,17,Ffrequent across North Yorkshire.
OL,18,FStaying rather windy and feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
