OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FChilly
OL,6,Fbut fine start Wednesday, before cloud
OL,7,Fgradually thickens, with strengthening
OL,8,Fwinds. Dry start Thursday with winds
OL,9,Feasing, before rain spreads southeast
OL,10,Flater. Mild. Sunny spells Friday and
OL,11,Ffeeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
